// Angle (UnifiedPipes; README "Unified pipes"): a copper or lead half plate folded once across its
// middle at a right angle, two legs 4 voxels wide and 1 thick, 4 long (shapes/item/angle.json, the
// press brake's contract). Only the press brake makes one, from one half plate (the squaring shear's
// item). Two angles, two tin or silver solder bars and a soldering iron make one chute section, the
// hollow section (recipes/grid/chutesection.json): the section is bigger than its two angles, the
// accepted abstraction of that grid recipe. Marked disabled with the switch off.
